<title>USA: CME average feeder steer price.</title>
<headline>CME average feeder steer price.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange reported the average feeder steer price for the seven calendar days ending Friday, July 18  used for cash settlement of CME Feeder Cattle contracts. (in dollars per cwt) --</p>
<p>12-STATES - FOR 7 DAYS ENDING -</p>
<p>Friday	   July 18 $82.14   up 0.21</p>
<p>Thursday	 July 17 $81.93   up 0.23</p>
<p>Wednesday	July 16 $81.70   up 0.23</p>
